<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Nail, Nafhold, Metlife still talking.</title>
<headline>Nail, Nafhold, Metlife still talking.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Africa Investments Ltd (Nail), New Africa Finance Holdings Ltd (Nafhold) and Metropolitan Life Ltd (Metlife) said on Tuesday talks between Nail, Nafhold and Sankorp Limited were still continuing.</p>
<p>Referring to cautionaries dated April 3, and April 24, the three companies urged their shareholders to continue to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>The companies gave no further details in a brief statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
